      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i want to make sure the guide is really comprehensive though. could you expand on that? specifically, can you list the main theoretical frameworks we should use to teach this, and maybe point out which ones are considered the most scientifically accurate for explaining these patterns?",
